# Keep LF line endings on every platform, Windows included.
# The CSVs carry multi-line article bodies inside quoted fields, and the csv module
# keeps line endings there verbatim - a CRLF checkout changes every article's text,
# which changes the agent cache keys and silently stops the shipped Claude cache
# from replaying.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.pptx binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
